      title: 'Listing below the best bid',
      body:
        `Your price: ${fmtUnitPriceSats(impliedUnit)} sats/${_tickerSafe}\n` +
        `Best live bid: ${fmtUnitPriceSats(bb)} sats/${_tickerSafe}\n\n` +
        _fieldNote +
        `Publishing as-is hands the first taker your ${_tickerSafe} below what an existing buyer is already paying. ` +
        `Match the best bid instead — your listing fills at the better price the moment a taker arrives.`,
      confirmLabel: 'Publish below the bid anyway',
      cancelLabel: 'Cancel',
      kind: 'danger',
